    {
      "order": 6,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\n\n***This kshethram comprises two temples\n\nMoolavar: Devapiran / Aravindalochanan\nThayaar: Karuthadankanni Nachiyar\nVimanam: Kumuda Vimanam\nPushkarani: Varuna Theertham / Thamaraparani River\n\nTravel: This kshethram is one of the Nava Tirupati temples and is located around 3 km from Srivaikuntam.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nNam Azhwar: 11 Pasurams",
      "textFontSizeHint": 16
    },
